    "chunk_text": "on syx \u00fe\u00e6t pund, \u00feonne hatte se syxta d\u00e6l sextans, & \u00fea fife quincunx o\u00f0\u00f0e cincus. Gyf \u00feu tod\u00e6lst hw\u00e6t on feower, se feor\u00f0a d\u00e6l by\u00f0 quadrans geciged, & \u00fea o\u00f0re dodrantes beo\u00f0 Gyf \u00feu \u00e6nig \u00feing tod\u00e6lst on \u00fereo, \u00feonne hatte se \u00feridda d\u00e6l triens, & \u00fea twegen bisse. Gyf \u00feu tod\u00e6lst on twa, \u00feonne by\u00f0 se an d\u00e6l semis gehaten, & se o\u00f0er semis. Swylce ic tod\u00e6le \u00e6nne penig on twa, \u00feonne h\u00e6bbe ic healfne, & min cleric healfne, & min d\u00e6l by\u00f0 Gyt ic wylle ymbe \u00feis get\u00e6l wi\u00f0 \u00fee, la cleric, spr\u00e6ce habban. Semis ys swy\u00f0e w\u00e6w\u00e6r\u00f0lic to ongytanne, swa hyt ger\u00e6d ys on \u00fe\u00e6re boc \u00fee ys Exodus genemned: L\u00e6te we \u00feus ymbe \u00feys gesprecen. Her\u00e6fter we wylla\u00f0 geopenian uplendiscum preostum \u00fe\u00e6ra stafena gerena \u00e6fter Lydenwara \u00c6rest we willa\u00f0 hig amearkian tog\u00e6dere, & sy\u00f0\u00f0an heora tod\u00e6lednyssa we willa\u00f0 geky\u00f0an on \u00fea & \u00fe\u00e6t get\u00e6l \u00fe\u00e6ra stafena we \u00feenca\u00f0 to cy\u00f0anne, for\u00feon we witon \u00fe\u00e6t hyt m\u00e6g fremian. Primus i, an. ii secundas, twa. iii tertius, \u00fereo. iiii quartus, feower. v quintus, fif. vi sextus, syx. vii septimus, seofon. viii octauus, eahta. viiii nonus, nigon. x decimus, tyn. xi undecimus endlufon. xii",
